  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy Support for Improved Food Security and Livelihoods in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the capacity of MoAIWD to collect, compile, analyse, store and disseminate relevant and timely agricultural statistics and other information on food and agriculture, including land and natural resources for better informed decision making on the intensification of sustainable agricultural production. The program will also improve policy and program coherence for effective transformation of the agriculture sector.</narrative>
  </description>
